  "method": {
    "temperature": "IU GHCN-Daily TMAX; KBMG GHCNh highest accepted instantaneous temperature. Both rounded to whole \u00b0F.",
    "reporting_day": "(previous date 07:00, reporting date 07:00], America/Indiana/Indianapolis, including historical Indiana time rules and DST. IU dates retained as reported.",
    "coverage": "At least 95% of calendar days paired in each full year. KBMG days require at least 90% hourly-bin coverage and no gap over 3 hours, with official daily-extrema QC.",
    "changes": "Mean absolute difference between daily highs exactly 1, 2 or 3 calendar days apart. All intervening dates must be valid at both stations. Assigned to end-date year. This measures one change, not complete reversal cycles.",
    "weighting": "Annual points use identical dates at both stations. Overall summaries are weighted by paired days/windows, not equally by year.",
    "limitations": "Two station sites, not an urban-versus-rural causal estimate. Instruments, exposure, moves and continuous-versus-instantaneous maxima differ. Daily highs do not measure nighttime heat islands."
